---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../data/site';

const lastUpdated = 'August 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions"
  description="Terms of use for the MA Utility Solutions website, including our no-online-quotes policy, liability, intellectual property and governing law."
>
  <section class="bg-navy">
    <div class="container-page section-padding text-center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1 class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-4xl font-extrabold text-white sm:text-5xl">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-white/60">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-padding">
    <div class="container-page">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-10 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-light sm:text-base">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-navy sm:text-2xl">1. Introduction</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            These terms govern your use of the {SITE.name} website ({SITE.url}). By using this website, you accept
            these terms in full. If you disagree with any part of these terms, please do not use this website.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-navy sm:text-2xl">2. Who we are</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            {SITE.name} is an independent UK brokerage helping homeowners and businesses compare and switch energy,
            water and solar providers, and sourcing trades for building and renovation projects. We are not a
            supplier ourselves — we act as an intermediary between you and suppliers or contractors.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-navy sm:text-2xl">3. Use of this website</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            This website is provided for general information about our services and to allow you to get in touch
            with us. You agree to use it only for lawful purposes and in a way that does not infringe the rights of,
            or restrict or inhibit the use and enjoyment of, this website by any other party.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-navy sm:text-2xl">4. No online quotes</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            <strong class="text-navy">This website does not provide instant, automated or binding quotes of any
            kind.</strong> Energy, water and solar pricing depends on individual circumstances, current contracts,
            usage and live market conditions. Any figures, ranges or examples shown on this website are for
            illustrative purposes only and must not be relied upon as an offer or quotation. Accurate pricing is
            only provided following a direct conversation with us and, where applicable, authorisation via a Letter
            of Authority (LOA).
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-navy sm:text-2xl">5. Accuracy of information</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            We take reasonable care to ensure the information on this website is accurate at the time of
            publication, but we make no warranties or representations, express or implied, as to its completeness or
            accuracy. Market conditions, supplier offerings and regulations change, and content may not always
            reflect the very latest position.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-navy sm:text-2xl">6. Intellectual property</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Unless otherwise stated, {SITE.name} owns the intellectual property rights in this website and its
            content, including text, graphics and design. You may view, download and print pages for personal,
            non-commercial use, provided you do not modify the content or remove any copyright or proprietary
            notices.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-navy sm:text-2xl">7. Third-party links</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            This website may contain links to third-party websites, such as our Microsoft Bookings calendar. We are
            not responsible for the content, accuracy or practices of any linked third-party website, and including
            a link does not imply endorsement.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-navy sm:text-2xl">8. Limitation of liability</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            To the fullest extent permitted by law, {SITE.name} accepts no liability for any loss or damage arising
            from your use of, or inability to use, this website, or from reliance on any information published on
            it. Nothing in these terms excludes or limits our liability for death or personal injury caused by
            negligence, fraud, or any other liability that cannot be excluded or limited under English law.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-navy sm:text-2xl">9. Governing law</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            These terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of England and Wales. Any disputes
            relating to these terms will be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of England and
            Wales.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-extrabold text-navy sm:text-2xl">10. Related policies</h2>
          <p class="mt-3">
            Please also see our
            <a href="/privacy" class="font-semibold text-amber-dark hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>
            for information on how we handle personal data, and our
            <a href="/complaints" class="font-semibold text-amber-dark hover:underline">Complaints Procedure</a>
            if you're ever unhappy with our service.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
